  "contentHtml": "\n                      <p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">皆様、お疲れ様です。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">兵庫県出身</span><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp;19</span><span class=\"s1\">歳</span><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">歌っちゃった</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">小西ん</span><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s1\">こと</span><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s1\">小西夏菜実</span><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s1\">です︎</span><span class=\"s3\">🐺</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/konishi.nanami/2023-11-01/53193_0.jpg\" alt=\"A876D2BB-BA8D-4677-B968-0537806ED08A.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">リップ塗ってなくてゴメンナサーイ</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">【日向坂になりましょう】</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">Lemino</span><span class=\"s1\">さんで配信中の四期生の冠番組「日向坂になりましょう」</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">冒頭の約</span><span class=\"s2\">10</span><span class=\"s1\">分がなんと</span><span class=\"s2\">YouTube</span><span class=\"s1\">で先行公開されることになりました</span><span class=\"s3\">‼️‼️‼️</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">全国の方がひななりを目にするということですね</span><span class=\"s3\">🥹</span><span class=\"s1\">すごいです。ありがとうございます。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">ひななりをまだ見たことないそこのあなた</span><span class=\"s3\">❗️</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">ぜひこの機会にチェックしてみてください♪</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">本日公開されたのは</span><span class=\"s2\">#14のミュージカル企画です</span><span class=\"s1\">！</span><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s1\">劇団四季の歌唱指導講師、久保佳那子さんに歌い方や表現の仕方を教えていただきました。舞台やミュージカルにずっと興味があったので今回久保さんに学ばせていただきとても貴重な経験となりました</span><span class=\"s3\">✨</span><span class=\"s1\">ありがとうございました</span><span class=\"s3\">☺️</span><span class=\"s1\">歌上手になりたーーい！！！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">笑いあり涙ありの</span><span class=\"s2\">30</span><span class=\"s1\">分です！！平尾、平岡、宮地、小西が「ってか」をソロ歌唱しています！！ド緊張ガエルだった！！最後には感動のエンディングです</span><span class=\"s2\">...</span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\">⬇️</span></p>\n<p class=\"p5\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/fJDMDDArhsI?si=kt3G8nU_hfLbKA78\">https://youtu.be/fJDMDDArhsI?si=kt3G8nU_hfLbKA78</a></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">【ミート</span><span class=\"s2\">&amp;</span><span class=\"s1\">グリート】</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">2nd</span><span class=\"s1\">アルバムのミート</span><span class=\"s2\">&amp;</span><span class=\"s1\">グリートがあと一枠となりました</span><span class=\"s3\">😭</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">皆様、いつも本当にありがとうございます</span><span class=\"s3\">😭💝</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">今後の活動でたくさん恩返しできるように頑張ります！！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">明日の</span><span class=\"s2\">14</span><span class=\"s1\">時まで</span></p>\n<p class=\"p5\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">1</span><span class=\"s1\">月</span><span class=\"s2\">20</span><span class=\"s1\">日の</span><span class=\"s2\">1</span><span class=\"s1\">部</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">が受付中です</span><span class=\"s3\">❣️❣️</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">ぜひよろしくお願いします</span><span class=\"s3\">🐰</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p5\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><a href=\"https://fortunemusic.jp/hinatazaka46_202311/\">https://fortunemusic.jp/hinatazaka46_202311/</a></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">【新参者】</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">ついに明後日が新参者初日になります。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">1</span><span class=\"s1\">ヶ月間ほぼリハーサルの毎日を過ごしてきました。おもてなし会リハーサル期間の四期生は全員で一斉に気持ちが落ちて大変なことになりがちだった脆いチームだったのが正直なところですが、</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">新参者のリハーサル期間ではお互いが高めあい支え合う強い四期生になったと私は感じました。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">私の原動力は八割型</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"s1\">悔しい</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"s1\">でできています。全然負けず嫌いとかじゃないけど、できない自分への悔しさ</span><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s1\">周りと比べられる悔しさ</span><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s1\">そういう悔しい気持ちが私の原動力です。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">メンバー全員が何度も何度も話し合ってどんどん強く、固く結ばれていった団結力で</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">皆様が</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"s1\">一体感</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"s1\">を感じて帰っていただくことが本望です！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">明後日から</span><span class=\"s2\">10</span><span class=\"s1\">公演、どうぞよろしくお願いいたします。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><sp